    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is &quot;my&quot; story...<br>And the answers &quot;I&quot; seek...<br>Reborn and unwilling to lead an ordinary life, &quot;I&quot; embarked on a journey...<br>Meet companions, explore and adventure, defend and lay siege to cities, become a lord, and continually raise your noble status...<br>Silvermoon Harbor, Rhode Town, the fortress city of Kluborg...<br>Ahead lie even more prosperous cities, and the stories &quot;I&quot; experience will become ever more thrilling...<br>How many unknown secrets lie hidden in this world?<br>To what heights can &quot;I&quot; ultimately rise?<br>The journey continues, and the answers will ultimately be determined by &quot;me&quot;...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic turn-based role-playing game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >68 joinable companions, each with their own unique characteristics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 500 types of enemies across seven major regions, and a massive city siege strategy system!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 weapon types, each with its own distinctive skill system!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique Fighting Spirit (Dou Qi) weapon-binding system!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast magic system and a unique amplification system!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 major starting origins, each offering a completely new gameplay experience!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each region features rich and distinctive side quests and exploration gameplay!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light novel-level character side stories provide an immersive fantasy adventure experience</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is &quot;my&quot; story...<br>And the answers &quot;I&quot; seek...<br>Reborn and unwilling to lead an ordinary life, &quot;I&quot; embarked on a journey...<br>Meet companions, explore and adventure, defend and lay siege to cities, become a lord, and continually raise your noble status...<br>Silvermoon Harbor, Rhode Town, the fortress city of Kluborg...<br>Ahead lie even more prosperous cities, and the stories &quot;I&quot; experience will become ever more thrilling...<br>How many unknown secrets lie hidden in this world?<br>To what heights can &quot;I&quot; ultimately rise?<br>The journey continues, and the answers will ultimately be determined by &quot;me&quot;...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic turn-based role-playing game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >68 joinable companions, each with their own unique characteristics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 500 types of enemies across seven major regions, and a massive city siege strategy system!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 weapon types, each with its own distinctive skill system!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique Fighting Spirit (Dou Qi) weapon-binding system!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast magic system and a unique amplification system!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 major starting origins, each offering a completely new gameplay experience!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each region features rich and distinctive side quests and exploration gameplay!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light novel-level character side stories provide an immersive fantasy adventure experience</p></li></ul>",
